omx-plugins (0.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.5.0: omx pitch reports its latency; version and changelogs
    (#110)
  * omx pitch: the latency at full mix is where the impulse lands, 0 at half
    mix (#110)
  * oracle: the declaration's latency checks, an impulse through both faces
    at every rate (#110)
  * CLAP faces: the latency changes only at activation, after a restart asked
    once (#110)
  * Pin omx-dsp 0.6.0, whose pitch face reports its latency (#110)
  * Declarations: console comments in plain words, no source symbols
  * gen: a released parameter list is read from the parameter table alone
    (#107)
  * gen: a released parameter list is read from the parameter table alone
    (#107)
  * docs: BUILDING names look.mjs and its token source (#105)
  * schema: the panel is declared once; console.panel is gone, a second copy
    is refused (#100)
  * plugins: MOD GUIs regenerated, selectors named selector (#101)
  * build: make test and CI check look.json against its tokens (#105)
  * plugins: one panel per declaration, the console's sections and graphs
    folded into it (#100)
  * tools: modgui-gen reads the schema's widgets, honours panel.widgets and
    draws a fader (#101)
  * tools: look.json is generated from tools/look/tokens.css by look.mjs
    (#105)
  * schema: the shared widgets are the console's names, selector where choice
    was (#101)
  * plugins: every panel declares a family and roles of the console's
    vocabulary (#99)
  * schema: panel.family and panel.roles are the console's closed set, a
    declaration outside it is refused (#99)
  * tools: a variant's per-band role names every band's parameter (#99)
  * panel description: a panel family the extension has no place for is none
    (#107)
  * panel description: a panel family the extension has no place for is none
    (#107)
  * test: the CLAP face's contract, pages and placement defaults read back
    against the declaration (#102)
  * faces: CLAP serves param-contract/1, remote controls and track-info from
    the declaration (#102)
  * panel description: the contract's per-placement defaults, and the
    sections as remote-control pages (#102)
  * param contract: every plugin's rows of org.openmixer.param-contract/1,
    from its declaration (#102)
  * omx-contract reader: a travel's per-kind defaults reach the resolved
    parameters (#102)
  * test: each built face's panel description read back as a host reads it,
    against the declaration (#107)
  * faces: CLAP and LV2 serve org.openmixer.panel-description/1 from the
    generated rows (#107)
  * panel description: every plugin's rows of
    org.openmixer.panel-description/1, from its declaration (#107)
  * declarations: the EQ, keyed gate and drive panels name the graph drawn
    over them (#107)
  * test: the LV2 port groups read back through lilv against the declaration
    (#103)
  * LV2 faces: one port group per panel section, each section's parameters in
    it (#103)
  * Declarations: the console stage comments name no private branch or file

